Derived from the NetHack tiles and distributed under the NetHack General
Public License (see nethack/dat/license).

The sheet uses tile2bmp's order (monsters, objects, other, then a greyscale
copy of every monster tile for statues), 40 tiles per row; glyph_info's
gm.tileidx indexes it.
